id tube diameters are appropriate for unit capacity.)>>endobj366 0 obj<</D(G1450528)/S/GoTo>>endobj333 0 obj<</A 367 0 R/Next 365 0 R/Parent 327 0 R/Prev 330 0 R/Title(2. Locate unit away from windows, patios, decks, etc. where unit operation sound may disturb customer.)>>endobj367 0 obj<</D(G1450527)/S/GoTo>>endobj332 0 obj<</D(G1591588)/S/GoTo>>endobj326 0 obj<</D(G1450512)/S/GoTo>>endobj16 0 obj<</Kids[368 0 R 369 0 R 370 0 R 371 0 R 372 0 R]>>endobj375 0 obj<</Names[(FrameMaker)376 0 R]>>endobj376 0 obj<</JS()/S/JavaScript>>endobj368 0 obj<</Limits[(F)(G1450576)]/Names[(F)[5 0 R/XYZ 0 792 null](G1422049)[5 0 R/XYZ 35 664 null](G1422050)[5 0 R/XYZ 35 637 null](G1450512)[5 0 R/XYZ 35 422 null](G1450514)[5 0 R/XYZ 35 261 null](G1450525)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 329 null](G1450527)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 277 null](G1450528)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 253 null](G1450529)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 229 null](G1450530)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 205 null](G1450531)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 192 null](G1450532)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 168 null](G1450533)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 144 null](G1450534)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 120 null](G1450535)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 96 null](G1450536)[5 0 R/XYZ 313 72 null](G1450537)[6 0 R/XYZ 35 548 null](G1450539)[6 0 R/XYZ 35 287 null](G1450542)[7 0 R/XYZ 313 674 null](G1450544)[6 0 R/XYZ 35 271 null](G1450549)[6 0 R/XYZ 35 129 null](G1450550)[6 0 R/XYZ 35 114 null](G1450552)[6 0 R/XYZ 35 87 null](G1450554)[6 0 R/XYZ 313 736 null](G1450557)[6 0 R/XYZ 313 354 null](G1450558)[6 0 R/XYZ 313 302 null](G1450560)[6 0 R/XYZ 313 247 null](G1450564)[6 0 R/XYZ 313 96 null](G1450566)[7 0 R/XYZ 35 760 null](G1450574)[6 0 R/XYZ 313 651 null](G1450575)[6 0 R/XYZ 313 370 null](G1450576)[6 0 R/XYZ 313 367 null]]>>endobj369 0 obj<</Limits[(G1450654)(G1544889)]/Names[(G1450654)[7 0 R/XYZ 35 481 null](G1450657)[7 0 R/XYZ 35 203 null](G1450660)[7 0 R/XYZ 313 688 null](G1450662)[7 0 R/XYZ 313 593 null](G1450761)[8 0 R/XYZ 35 253 null](G1450767)[8 0 R/XYZ 35 118 null](G1450768)[8 0 R/XYZ 35 107 null](G1450769)[8 0 R/XYZ 35 96 null](G145